      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "optional"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the clay pot over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute",
    "Add the brown rice and stir to coat the rice with oil and mix with onion and garlic",
    "Add the lemon juice, paprika, cumin, salt, and black pepper, and stir well",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the clay pot, and simmer for 20 minutes",
    "Turn off the heat and let it rest for 5 minutes",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and garnish with chopped fresh parsley if desired"
  ],
